"Players control a stylized bird using a single-tap mechanic to apply upward impulse, countering constant gravity. The core gameplay involves navigating through narrow vertical gaps between scrolling pipes. The visual style utilizes vibrant 8-bit pixel art with a parallax-scrolling background to create a sense of movement. The win condition is score-maximization, where players earn points for every set of obstacles successfully cleared. Collision with any pipe or the ground results in an immediate game over. The difficulty scales through tighter gap placement and increased scrolling speed, emphasizing precision timing and rhythm-based reflexes."